    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# WordPress VoiceOvers – AI-Powered Text-to-Speech\n\nAutomatically convert WordPress articles into Italian and English audio using Google Cloud Text-to-Speech. The workflow retrieves published content, generates multilingual voiceovers, stores audio in Google Cloud Storage, and updates dedicated WordPress pages with embedded audio players.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. **Fetch Posts** – Retrieves recent WordPress articles on a daily schedule.\n2. **Prepare Content** – Extracts readable text from HTML and stores article metadata in Google Sheets.\n3. **Manage Queue** – Selects the oldest unprocessed article to avoid duplicate processing.\n4. **Translate Content** – Uses Google Translate to prepare the English version while preserving the original Italian text.\n5. **Generate Voiceovers** – Sends both versions to a Google Cloud Run Text-to-Speech service, which generates WAV audio files.\n6. **Publish Audio** – Updates dedicated WordPress pages with audio players linked to Google Cloud Storage.\n7. **Track Execution** – Marks completed articles as `done` or records processing errors in Google Sheets.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- WordPress website with REST API access\n- Google Cloud project with Text-to-Speech, Cloud Run, Cloud Storage and Translation services\n- Google Sheets for article tracking and processing status\n- Google Cloud service account with appropriate permissions\n- Cloud Run TTS endpoint with API key authentication\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Connect your WordPress and Google Cloud credentials.\n2. Configure the Google Sheets document and worksheet.\n3. Deploy and configure the Cloud Run Text-to-Speech service.\n4. Replace the Cloud Run endpoint and configure the `X-API-Key` authentication header.\n5. Set the Google Cloud Storage bucket name and target WordPress page IDs.\n6. Test the workflow with one article before enabling the schedule.\n\n## Customization\n\nAdjust the execution schedule, article retrieval window, TTS voices, languages and WordPress audio player formatting to match your website.\n\n## Documentation & Support\n\n**Documentation:** [Full Setup & Technical Documentation](https://app.notion.com/p/3f5f0ba27c3280478f82ccabfa9a0b7c)\n\nFor custom implementation, workflow integration, troubleshooting or consulting services, contact me through [paoloronco.it](https://paoloronco.it).\n\n---\n\n**Note:** This template requires your own Google Cloud infrastructure and credentials. Cloud services may incur usage costs. Review all configuration values and permissions before activating the workflow.",
        "height": 1184,
        "width": 592,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
